Package: libsystemc20-dev
Architecture: any
Section: devel
Description: SystemC v2.0 development libraries
 SystemC is a HDL based on a C++ class library intended for
 simulations using standard C++ tools. This package provides the
 requires libraries and header files to perform SystemC simulations.
